# Overview

Run a kernel optimization round for the current workload and hardware.
Combine, adapt, and iterate on techniques as the evidence warrants. Preserve the
complete problem, ordered ABI, numerical behavior, and backend. Return the best
validated result reached in this round.
{% if use_memory %}
Use the mounted skills as references alongside source-guided optimization.
{% else %}
Optimize independently from the input code and target hardware.
{% endif %}

